                        "username": "rcheng123"
                    },
                    "message": "done. setting this patch to only moving retry logics. moving impl for \"if eeprom use page addressing bits\" to https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/84053"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/fru_device/fru_device.cpp",
