                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "IMO retry logic should be a separate function from the thing that it's retrying, in cases like this where it's more than 5 lines or so.\n\nIt will help to separate the two since the `tries` variable will not be in scope for the logic that's being retried."
                },
                {
